      "section": "btm",
      "title": "Breaking the Mold",
      "description": "Representation in commercial photography is a necessary component to not only drive impactful change but to lend an inspiring voice for those seeking to identify with something more. Here, we celebrate diversity and encompass a broad spectrum of individual expression.",
